# Tailwind scale

Do not write size utilities with arbitrary values in brackets.

If the design is close to the default scale, use the nearest step. If it is a deliberate size, add a named token in `@theme` (`src/index.css`) and use the alias.

Variants with brackets (`aria-[current=page]:`, `group-aria-[current=page]:`) are allowed.

```tsx
// BAD
<h1 className="text-[11px] max-w-[430px]">Title</h1>

// GOOD
<h1 className="text-2xs max-w-phone">Title</h1>
```
